- [drizzle.config.ts](mdc:backend/drizzle.config.ts) - Database configuration
- [ecosystem.config.cjs](mdc:backend/ecosystem.config.cjs) - PM2 deployment config

## Environment Variables
Required environment variables (validated in [env.ts](mdc:backend/src/env.ts)):
- `OPENAI_API_KEY` - OpenAI API access
- `PORT` - Server port
- `GROQ_API_KEY` - Groq API access
- `JWT_SECRET` - JWT signing secret (optional, defaults for development)

